},{"text":"that queries and updates them. An entity holds at most one component of each type.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To make a type a component, declare its conformance. There are no requirements to implement:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Lifetime: Component { var remaining: Double }","","var world = World()","let spark = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Lifetime(remaining: 0.5))","","world[Lifetime.self, of: spark].remaining -= 0.25","print(world[Lifetime.self, of: spark].remaining)","\/\/ Prints \"0.25\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every component is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle","isActive":true},{"text":" of itself, so you can pass one anywhere a bundle is expected,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","isActive":true},{"text":" that matches the entities holding it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Requiring-Other-Components","type":"heading","text":"Requiring Other Components"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A component can require others. Spawning an entity with the component, or inserting the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component into an entity, also inserts each required component the entity doesn’t hold, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whatever those components require in turn. List the required components in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component\/required-u15k","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Player: Component {","    static var required: some Bundle {","        Position(x: 0, y: 0)","        Health(current: 100)","    }","}","","var world 